github-copilot.toml is saved here as copilot.toml, and antigravity.toml
as agy.toml.
opencode.toml has been changed here for opencode 2: work is read from the
footer's "esc interrupt" hint and the ■/⬝ progress bar, and a permission
dialog from its title and footer together — so quoting the hint or the
title in a conversation is not read as working or asking.
copilot.toml has been changed here for copilot 1.0.98: waiting for
background agents is read whatever dot the line starts with.
